Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get what you really want.\NI want more. Anyone more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.88,0:00:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going on the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again, you\Nknow what I mean, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can make my dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know what is\NSomething is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away. The great\Nend of the unknown rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.68,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't do it, so\Ncan you. Only without.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Party for tomorrow. Go\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you cannot achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.22,0:01:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going, roaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your eyes that\NI want, but your weary ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:02:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your light.\NShine like a star to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong. Just that\Nyou can't achieve your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Out of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.76,0:03:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get to the\Ncenter of town! Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.94,0:03:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Those buildings are getting\Ndragged across the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're coming straight for us! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The kingdom's getting crushed into a ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.68,0:03:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And us along with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.18,0:03:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The birdcage is shrinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.28,0:03:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That would explain the mass panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.66,0:03:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The birdcage buries everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.62,0:04:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, this is a nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.66,0:04:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I see the battle isn't over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.48,0:04:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I found honey again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.78,0:04:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.02,0:04:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna sit here picking my\Nnose waiting for death to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.94,0:04:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Go find our fallen\Nallies—get them back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.24,0:04:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.28,0:04:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.48,0:04:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the battle goes on for too long, even\Nthis plateau will be cut to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.02,0:04:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.10,0:04:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought this was the middle\Nof the kingdom isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The safest place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Look above.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.27,0:04:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.68,0:04:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,center is slowly moving too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.36,0:04:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably closing in on\Nthe royal palace on top of the.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.68,0:04:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,plateau.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.51,0:04:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, where Doflamingo\Nis fighting right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless we push toward the center,\Nwe'll be shredded like everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.84,0:05:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we're in the midst of it,\NI see that things are quite chaotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.72,0:05:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Cesaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Might I inquire where\Nyou're going, Sir Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.80,0:05:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.92,0:05:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.09,0:05:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to stop that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.90,0:05:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.18,0:05:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew there were little\Npeople here in Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.00,0:05:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope your arm turns out all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.62,0:05:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They said it should be back in working\Norder once the blood flow returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.00,0:05:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.24,0:05:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When I saw that underground\Nport, one thing became clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.20,0:06:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is much bigger than one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we defeat Doflamingo,\Nthe battle won't be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.30,0:06:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But it will cause\Nripples across the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.60,0:06:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And all eyes will be on you and Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.70,0:06:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.72,0:06:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,4th gear, do tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.48,0:06:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.70,0:06:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta kick your ass in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing like second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.98,0:07:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bounce man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.22,0:08:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, is this supposed to be a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You certainly got big.\NI'll give you that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.44,0:08:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think a balloon scares me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I thought you had some\Nsecret strategy to win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.34,0:08:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bounce me to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.72,0:08:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even stand on\Nyour own two feet anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.64,0:08:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you supposed to kick my\Nass with a stupid power like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,For two whole years, I\Nfought against wild animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,As huge and savage as any\Nmonster you could think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.96,0:08:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If I wanted to wrestle them to the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.66,0:08:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I needed greater size\Nand greater bounciness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.70,0:08:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And what good does elasticity do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.54,0:09:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.12,0:09:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I start, you won't\Neven be able to fight back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.76,0:09:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone stand back.\NDon't move. What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.58,0:10:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,are you doing here i'd\Nlike to know that myself
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.08,0:10:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.99,0:10:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll end up hitting the breadcrumbs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It really knocked me a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's using elastic force to fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's my Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.86,0:11:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Rhino Schneider!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.48,0:11:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody else showed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.24,0:11:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's massive!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.48,0:11:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And it looks like he's strong, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.24,0:11:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a... giant... ball man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.26,0:11:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's hardening his skin with\Narmament Haki and using the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.12,0:11:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,tensile force to multiply his\Nstrength several times over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.94,0:11:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna lose to a ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.02,0:12:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stronger than rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sick of this crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.38,0:12:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I'm using 4th\Ngear, you can't keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.78,0:12:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come, Mingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think\Nyou're dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.26,0:13:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.76,0:13:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,To the red!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.46,0:13:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Athlete!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.18,0:13:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with the armor,\Nhe's still like rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.82,0:13:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that's going to work on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.04,0:13:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.43,0:13:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare try and run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to get that ass kicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.26,0:13:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.88,0:13:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It keeps going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.12,0:14:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chase him down. Python!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How far can his arm stretch?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.28,0:14:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.28,0:14:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough! Teach this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And now comes on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Culverin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.40,0:15:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He got a beating! Doflamingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.38,0:15:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,From a ball? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.60,0:15:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, who's that? He's strong. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.22,0:15:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock him dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.48,0:15:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.66,0:15:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.30,0:16:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.46,0:16:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.64,0:16:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.08,0:16:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, if he can overpower\NDoflamingo, he must be quite strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.79,0:16:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,he's overusing his Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.70,0:16:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.24,0:16:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess they're playing somewhere else now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.02,0:16:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And after I went to all that trouble\Nto come over here and see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.32,0:16:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain of the first ship of the\NBlackbeard Pirates, Jesus Burgess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.76,0:16:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I found him. Chase them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Or wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.88,0:16:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, they're mine for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.26,0:16:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get what I want, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.54,0:16:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wee!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.77,0:16:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's after Luffy's group.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.90,0:16:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's his motive?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.00,0:16:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Viola.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.91,0:17:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,His fight with Luffy is\Nall that remains, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.06,0:17:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.02,0:17:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the top executives and their\Nunderlings have been eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.40,0:17:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Doflamingo remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.72,0:17:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move, Tontanus!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.16,0:17:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.78,0:17:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Step up, or else you guys are\Ngonna be super dead in a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.82,0:17:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We managed to rescue all our friends\Nwho were stranded in the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're good to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.48,0:17:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.78,0:17:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the building's leaning over!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Froland, why is the Smile Factory the\Nonly thing that's not getting cut off?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.18,0:17:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.16,0:17:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, the Sea Prism Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.96,0:17:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sea Prism?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:17:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what the\Nwalls are made out of.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.06,0:17:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty strong stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.98,0:18:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means, the strings cut everything\Nelse, but the factory won't crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.50,0:18:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, watch. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.94,0:18:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just pushing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.26,0:18:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's them! Cranky!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.08,0:18:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Sir Robot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.36,0:18:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Saru Land. Top that land!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.78,0:18:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, guys, what gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.90,0:18:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Center of the country is kind\Nof in the other direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to run? Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.89,0:18:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not running.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.86,0:18:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to stop the strings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.44,0:18:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even think about that. Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.82,0:18:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.84,0:18:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over until Luffy settles\Nthe score, but we can buy some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:18:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.84,0:19:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with his armament active, he can still\Nexpand and contract with such precision.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.92,0:19:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Armament and rubber\Nworking in harmony, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.94,0:19:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If I take too long, I'll change back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.66,0:19:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like you've figured out\Nhow to use that ability pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.96,0:19:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But it must take a toll\Non you after a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.02,0:19:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it has its risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.56,0:19:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're tired, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.98,0:20:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How long can you hold out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.90,0:20:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can use my strings as much as I'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.40,0:20:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Culverin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.96,0:20:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Off what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.94,0:20:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.26,0:20:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.14,0:20:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, what have you done to this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.20,0:20:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen closely, rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.54,0:20:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My Devil Fruit's power ascended.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.42,0:20:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They've reached a new horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.86,0:20:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A higher state known as Awakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.24,0:20:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.15,0:20:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He turns the buildings into strings!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.28,0:20:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Awakening is extremely rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.40,0:20:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But with it, my strings can\Naffect more than just my own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.08,0:20:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.99,0:20:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,His strings are all over the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.02,0:20:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be a parameathia!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.10,0:21:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter which way you go,\Nthere's more strings. Fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.98,0:21:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, you won't\Neven be able to get near me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.30,0:21:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tick-tock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.32,0:21:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Any minute now, your\Nbody's going to give out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.82,0:21:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And mine will keep on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.44,0:21:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hockey's about to run out. Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when I'll deliver\Nthe finishing blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.18,0:22:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to run, or let's just pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.40,0:22:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.88,0:22:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd stand up\Nfor you and make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.10,0:22:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.40,0:22:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't run anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.90,0:22:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me and save yourself, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.32,0:22:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.62,0:22:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to abandon you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.02,0:22:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.60,0:22:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end for me either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.70,0:22:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.20,0:22:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, I don't have\Nenough strength to run downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.96,0:22:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.14,0:22:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,People!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.10,0:22:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We need help here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.96,0:22:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All these patients, they can't get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.50,0:22:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And we can't carry them by ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.04,0:23:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.64,0:23:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's wearing a Kuma shirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.88,0:23:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.92,0:23:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be someone who\Ncan help me find my baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.50,0:23:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody's gonna die no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.38,0:23:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.70,0:23:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we run you're stuck in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.78,0:23:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo will kill us anyway,\Nso it's easier to just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.34,0:23:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, listen well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.60,0:23:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.90,0:24:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,King, rather, former king, Rick Dolgo III.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.84,0:24:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.58,0:24:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really him?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.12,0:24:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.92,0:24:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of the game that the current\NKing Doflamingo has forced upon us,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.50,0:24:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been trapped inside this\Nbirdcage with seemingly no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.48,0:24:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And, to make matters even more\Nbleak, the cage is rapidly shrinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.62,0:24:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,slicing everything in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.14,0:24:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Rick...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.05,0:24:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This was thrust upon you so suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.88,0:24:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your emotions\Ncould barely keep up,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.00,0:24:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and now you struggle to survive\Nand protect your loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.84,0:24:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This may feel like a\Nnightmare, but it's quite real,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.62,0:24:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and this tragedy did not just begin today,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.26,0:25:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,because for a whole decade,\NDressrosa was already a birdcage,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.74,0:25:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and all of us were being held inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.28,0:25:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,under the oppressive reign of pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.18,0:25:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,For ten years now we have been puppets,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.24,0:25:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,constantly being manipulated\Nby the strings that they
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.96,0:25:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,pulled.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.87,0:25:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Such has been our reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.00,0:25:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But soon that is going to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.72,0:25:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The fear Don Quixote family,\Nwhom we believe were unstoppable,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.30,0:25:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,have nearly been eliminated\Nby a group of mighty warriors
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.64,0:25:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,who only happen to be\Npassing through our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.38,0:25:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,None of the executives are\Nleft standing. Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.76,0:25:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.90,0:25:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but it wasn't us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.98,0:25:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The final obstacle is him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.86,0:25:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The ruthless tyrant who has\NCheshrosa under his thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.62,0:25:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do Flamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.12,0:26:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And the brave soul who is doing battle\Nwith him is Luffy of the Straw Hat Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.40,0:26:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe he'll save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.12,0:26:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll destroy this\Nbirdcage once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.74,0:26:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That win or lose, it\Nwill end in mere minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.66,0:26:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So try to survive until then,\Nno matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.72,0:26:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Our dear country may be crumbling, but\NI cannot allow you to go down with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.72,0:26:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I implore you to keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.82,0:26:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you run out of breath\Nor your legs are broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.74,0:26:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,For a few minutes, please try to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.32,0:26:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There is still hope for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.74,0:26:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why you mustn't surrender yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.80,0:27:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do our best alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.28,0:27:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.04,0:27:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.04,0:27:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.68,0:27:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.16,0:27:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You should do what King Rick says.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.98,0:27:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.10,0:27:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all run downtown together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.16,0:27:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Help the patients!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.72,0:27:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab the beds!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.96,0:27:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.64,0:27:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.46,0:27:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to survive\Nuntil the battle's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.00,0:27:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That Straw Hat pirate is going to put\NDoflamingo in his place! I know it! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.78,0:28:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I said Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.78,0:28:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your demise is long overdue.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.36,0:28:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not much time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.52,0:28:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole town's starting to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.20,0:28:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now billow white.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.44,0:28:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.48,0:28:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll blow you away!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.60,0:28:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mine now!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.10,0:29:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to end this for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.58,0:29:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With my Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.72,0:29:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo Bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.86,0:29:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He won.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.42,0:30:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He beat the flamingo!
